omposed: write `Label`, a `Group` holding the `Checkbox` items, `Text slot=\"description\"`, and `FieldError`. The `Group` takes its axis, gap, and presentational role from the group's `orientation`, so a bare `<Group>` is all you need; pass your own `direction`/`gap` to lay the items out differently. Each `Checkbox` takes label text next to the indicator."},"365":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-30","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#data-attributes","content":"Components automatically add data attributes for styling different states:"},"366":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-31","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#data-attributes","content":"**CheckboxGroup Container:** `data-invalid`, `data-disabled`, `data-required`, `data-readonly`, `data-orientation`"},"367":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-32","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#data-attributes","content":"**Checkbox:** `data-selected`, `data-indeterminate`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-disabled`"},"368":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-33","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#component-customization","content":"Pass `className` or `style` to customize a checkbox field container. Use descendant data-attribute selectors to style the interactive checkbox state:"},"369":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-34","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#indeterminate-state","content":"The `isIndeterminate` prop displays a minus icon to represent a partial selection state. This is useful for \"select all\" checkboxes when only some items in a collection are selected."},"370":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-35","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#group-validation","content":"CheckboxGroup supports validation states and error messages:"},"371":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-36","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#group-validation","content":"**isRequired**: Marks the group as required with visual indicator"},"372":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-37","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#group-validation","content":"**isInvalid**: Shows error state styling"},"373":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-38","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#group-validation","content":"**`FieldError`**: Displays validation error text below the group"},"374":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-39","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#orientation","content":"Use `orientation=\"vertical\"` (default) to stack checkboxes, or `orientation=\"horizontal\"` to arrange them in a row."},"375":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-40","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#keyboard-navigation","content":"**Tab**: Moves focus to the next/previous checkbox"},"376":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-41","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#keyboard-navigation","content":"**Space**: Toggles the focused checkbox"},"377":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-42","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#keyboard-navigation","content":"**Shift + Tab**: Moves focus to the previous checkbox"},"378":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-43","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#aria-support","content":"`aria-disabled` for disabled checkboxes"},"379":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-44","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#aria-support","content":"`aria-required` when selection is required"},"380":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-45","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#aria-support","content":"`aria-invalid` for validation errors"},"381":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-46","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#aria-support","content":"Proper labeling with `aria-labelledby` and `aria-describedby`"},"382":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-47","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#indeterminate-state-not-updating","content":"The `isIndeterminate` prop must be explicitly managed - it doesn't automatically reflect parent-child relationships:"},"383":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-48","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#when-to-use-checkboxes","content":"✅ For selecting multiple independent options"},"384":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-49","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#when-to-use-checkboxes","content":"✅ When users can select zero, one, or many items"},"385":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-50","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#when-to-use-checkboxes","content":"✅ For toggling settings or features on/off"},"386":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-51","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#when-to-use-checkboxes","content":"✅ When all available options should be visible"},"387":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-52","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#when-to-use-checkboxes","content":"❌ For mutually exclusive options (use Radio instead)"},"388":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-53","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#when-to-use-checkboxes","content":"❌ For simple on/off toggles without labels (use Toggle/Switch instead)"},"389":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-54","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#label-guidelines","content":"Use clear, concise labels that describe what selecting the option means"},"390":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-55","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#label-guidelines","content":"Keep labels short (1-5 words when possible)"},"391":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-56","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#label-guidelines","content":"Ensure labels are descriptive without being verbose"},"392":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-57","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#label-guidelines","content":"Place the most commonly selected options first in groups"},"393":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-58","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#validation","content":"Always provide clear error messages and use appropriate validation states:"},"394":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-59","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#group-organization","content":"Limit checkbox groups to 7-10 options for better usability"},"395":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-60","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#group-organization","content":"Use logical ordering (alphabetical, frequency of use, or importance)"},"396":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-61","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#group-organization","content":"Consider using CheckboxGroup for related options, even if there are only 2-3"},"397":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-62","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#group-organization","content":"Provide a group label that clearly describes the choice being made"},"398":{"id":"/docs/components/chip","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","type":"page","content":"Chip","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chip"},"399":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-0","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip","content":"Grouped pill-shaped items for selecting values and removing user-added filters or tokens."},"400":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-1","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chip#features","content":"Features"},"401":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-2","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chip#installation","content":"Installation"},"402":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-3","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chip#quick-start","content":"Quick start"},"403":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-4","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chip#examples","content":"Examples"},"404":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-5","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chip#customization","content":"Customization"},"405":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-6","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chip#content","content":"Content"},"406":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-7","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chip#selection-and-removal","content":"Selection and removal"},"407":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-8","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chip#layout-and-sizing","content":"Layout and sizing"},"408":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-9","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chip#button-composition","content":"Button composition"},"409":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-10","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chip#accessibility","content":"Accessibility"},"410":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-11","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chip#best-practices","content":"Best Practices"},"411":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-12","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chip#troubleshooting","content":"Troubleshooting"},"412":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-13","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chip#a-chipgroup-has-no-accessible-name","content":"A ChipGroup has no accessible name"},"413":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-14","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chip#the-remove-action-does-not-update-the-ui","content":"The remove action does not update the UI"},"414":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-15","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chip#a-composed-label-is-not-truncating-correctly","content":"A composed label is not truncating correctly"},"415":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-16","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chip#the-menu-trigger-does-not-look-like-a-chip","content":"The menu trigger does not look like a Chip"},"416":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-17","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chip#props","content":"Props"},"417":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-18","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chip#chip","content":"Chip"},"418":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-19","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chip#chipgroup","content":"ChipGroup"},"419":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-20","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chip#chiplist","content":"ChipList"},"420":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-21","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chip#chipbutton","content":"ChipButton"},"421":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-22","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#features","content":"`ChipGroup` + `ChipList` + `Chip` for grouped values, selection, keyboard navigation, and removal"},"422":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-23","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#features","content":"Toggle Chips for selecting multiple peer filters"},"423":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-24","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#features","content":"Removable Chips for user-added filters and input tokens"},"424":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-25","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#features","content":"Shared `sm`, `md`, and `lg` sizes, with optional leading icons"},"425":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-26","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#features","content":"`ChipButton` for menu filters and other actions with a Chip-like appearance"},"426":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-27","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#examples","content":"import { ArgTypes, Meta } from '@storybook/addon-docs/blocks';\nimport { Examples } from '@bento/storybook-add"},"427":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-28","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#examples","content":"import { ArgTypes, Meta } from '@storybook/addon-docs/blocks';\nimport { Examples } from '@bento/storybook-addon-helpers/runtime';\nimport * as Stor"},"428":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-29","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#examples","content":"<Meta of={Stories} name=\"Overview\""},"429":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-30","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#content","content":"Use a string for a simple label. For icons or other composed content, wrap the\nvisible label in `Text` and provide `textValue` for the accessible name. See\n**Toggle Chips** and **Removable Chips** above."},"430":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-31","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#selection-and-removal","content":"`ChipGroup` owns selection and removal behavior. Use a Chip render prop for\nstate-dependent content, and `Button` with `slot=\"remove\"` together with\n`onRemove` for removable items. See **Toggle Chips** and **Removable Chips**."},"431":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-32","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#layout-and-sizing","content":"Set `size` on `ChipGroup` to keep a collection consistent. `ChipList` wraps by\ndefault and accepts layout props for custom arrangements. See **Sizes**."},"432":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-33","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#button-composition","content":"Use `ChipButton` when Chip presentation is needed without collection semantics.\nCompose it with components such as `MenuTrigger`; those components continue to\nown open state, focus, and keyboard behavior. See **Menu filter trigger**."},"433":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-34","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#accessibility","content":"Use `Label` or `aria-label` to name the `ChipGroup`; this names the collection,\nnot its individual Chips."},"434":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-35","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#accessibility","content":"Give each Chip a visible label, `textValue`, or `aria-label`. Use `textValue`\nwhen a Chip contains icons, composed content, or a render prop."},"435":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-36","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#accessibility","content":"Use a descriptive group label so removal actions can be announced clearly."},"436":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-37","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#accessibility","content":"Keep the visible label and the accessible value synchronized."},"437":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-38","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#accessibility","content":"`ChipButton` is a real button and exposes menu state through `MenuTrigger`; provide an accessible name when the visible content is incomplete."},"438":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-39","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#best-practices","content":"Keep labels concise and let them truncate only when the available width requires it."},"439":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-40","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#best-practices","content":"Prefer groups of three or more related values."},"440":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-41","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#best-practices","content":"Keep one size per group."},"441":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-42","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#best-practices","content":"Let `ChipList` wrap instead of forcing a single horizontal line."},"442":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-43","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#best-practices","content":"Use removable Chips for user-added filters and tokens."},"443":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-44","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#best-practices","content":"For menu filters, use `ChipButton` with `MenuTrigger` and provide the chevron explicitly."},"444":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-45","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#a-chipgroup-has-no-accessible-name","content":"Add a visible `Label` to the group or provide `aria-label`. For an individual Chip\nwith composed content, provide a visible label, `textValue`, or `aria-label`."},"445":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-46","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#the-remove-action-does-not-update-the-ui","content":"Add `onRemove` to `ChipGroup` and remove the returned keys from the collection\nowned by your application."},"446":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-47","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#a-composed-label-is-not-truncating-correctly","content":"Keep the label in `Text`, preserve `textValue`, and constrain the available width\nof the surrounding layout. Truncation is visual; the complete accessible value\nshould remain available."},"447":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-48","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#the-menu-trigger-does-not-look-like-a-chip","content":"Use `ChipButton` inside `MenuTrigger`, include the visible value, and add a\ntrailing chevron to communicate that the control opens a menu."},"448":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-49","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#props","content":"For a menu trigger, compose `MenuTrigger`, `Popover`, and `Menu`:"},"449":{"id":"/docs/components/circular-progress","page_id":"/docs/components/circular-progress","type":"page","content":"CircularProgress","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/circular-progress"},"450":{"id":"/docs/components/circular-progress-0","page_id":"/docs/components/circular-progress","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/circular-progress","content":"Composable circular progress with optional value, label, and description"},"451":{"id":"/docs/components/circular-progress-1","page_id":"/docs/components/circular-progress","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/circular-progress#installation","content":"Installation"},"452":{"id":"/docs/components/circular-progress-2","page_id":"/docs/components/circular-progress","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/circular-progress#examples","content":"Examples"},"453":{"id":"/docs/components/circular-progress-3","page_id":"/docs/components/circular-progress","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/circular-progress#customization","content":"Customization"},"454":{"id":"/docs/components/circular-progress-4","page_id":"/docs/components/circular-progress","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/circular-progress#accessibility","content":"Accessibility"},"455":{"id":"/docs/components/circular-progress-5","page_id":"/docs/components/circular-progress","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/circular-progress#migration","content":"Migration"},"456":{"id":"/docs/components/circular-progress-6","page_id":"/docs/components/circular-progress","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/circular-progress#props","content":"Props"},"457":{"id":"/docs/components/circular-progress-7","page_id":"/docs/components/circular-progress","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/circular-progress#circularprogress","content":"CircularProgress"},"458":{"id":"/docs/components/circular-progress-8","page_id":"/docs/components/circular-progress","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/circular-progress#examples","content":"import { ArgTypes, Meta } from '@storybook/addon-docs/blocks';"},"459":{"id":"/docs/components/circular-progress-9","page_id":"/docs/components/circular-progress","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/circular-progress#examples","content":"import { ArgTypes, Meta } from '@storybook/addon-docs/blocks';\nimport { Examples } from '@"},"460":{"id":"/docs/components/circular-progress-10","page_id":"/docs/components/circular-progress","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/circular-progress#examples","content":"import { ArgTypes, Meta } from '@storybook/addon-docs/blocks';\nimport { Examples } from '@bento/storybook-addon-helpers/runtime';\nimpor"},"461":{"id":"/docs/components/circular-progress-11","page_id":"/docs/components/circular-progress","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/circular-progress#examples","content":"import { ArgTypes, Meta } from '@storybook/addon-docs/blocks';\nimport { Examples } from '@bento/storybook-addon-helpers/runtime';\nimport * as Stories from './circ"},"462":{"id":"/docs/components/circular-progress-12","page_id":"/docs/components/circular-progress","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/circular-progress#customization","content":"Compose `Box slot=\"track\"` for the circular indicator and `Box slot=\"value\"` or `Text slot=\"value\"`\nfor formatted or custom content. The root's children render function provides progress state,\nincluding `percentage`, `valueText`, and `isIndeterminate`. Custom ranges and `formatOptions` apply\nconsistently to the indicator and formatted value. Use `valueLabel` to customize the accessible\nvalue text and the default visible value together."},"463":{"id":"/docs/components/circular-progress-13","page_id":"/docs/components/circular-progress","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/circular-progress#customization","content":"Use `status=\"default\"`, `\"success\"`, `\"warning\"`, or `\"critical\"` to choose the fill color,\nmatching ProgressBar. The default is `\"default\"`."},"464":{"id":"/docs/components/circular-progress-14","page_id":"/docs/components/circular-progress","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/circular-progress#customization","content":"The track and value share a grid area so the value is centered over the circle. Customize the\nlayout with Grid props, `className`, and `style`. Omit any optional part without changing the\nprogress semantics."},"465":{"id":"/docs/components/circular-progress-15","page_id":"/docs/components/circular-progress","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/circular-progress#accessibility","content":"Provide `Label`, `aria-label`, or `aria-labelledby` for the accessible name."},"466":{"id":"/docs/components/circular-progress-16","page_id":"/docs/components/circular-progress","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/circular-progress#accessibility","content":"The root retains `role=\"progressbar\"`, including when no visible value is composed."},"467":{"id":"/docs/components/circular-progress-17","page_id":"/docs/components/circular-progress","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/circular-progress#accessibility","content":"`Text slot=\"description\"` is associated automatically, preserving external `aria-describedby` references."},"468":{"id":"/docs/components/circular-progress-18","page_id":"/docs/components/circular-progress","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/circular-progress#accessibility","content":"Indeterminate progress hides the value slot, including custom content, and omits `aria-valuenow` and `aria-valuetext`."},"469":{"id":"/docs/components/circular-progress-19","page_id":"/docs/components/circular-progress","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/circular-progress#accessibility","content":"The circular track and repeated visible value are decorative and hidden from assistive technology."},"470":{"id":"/docs/components/circular-progress-20","page_id":"/docs/components/circular-progress","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/circular-progress#accessibility","content":"Reduced motion stops the activity animation while keeping the indicator visible."},"471":{"id":"/docs/components/circular-progress-21","page_id":"/docs/components/circular-progress","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/circular-progress#migration","content":"This is a breaking API change. Replace `label` with `Label` children and `helperText` with\n`Text slot=\"description\"`. The root no longer inserts a track or visible value automatically;\ncompose those slots explicitly to preserve the previous appearance."},"472":{"id":"/docs/components/circular-progress-22","page_id":"/docs/components/circular-progress","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/circular-progress#migration","content":"Rename the root's `emphasis` prop to `status` to match ProgressBar. The success, warning,\nand critical colors are unchanged; omitting `status` or setting it to `\"default\"` keeps the teal fill."},"473":{"id":"/docs/components/circular-progress-23","page_id":"/docs/components/circular-progress","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/circular-progress#migration","content":"Before:"},"474":{"id":"/docs/components/circular-progress-24","page_id":"/docs/components/circular-progress","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/circular-progress#migration","content":"After:"},"475":{"id":"/docs/components/circular-progress-25","page_id":"/docs/components/circular-progress","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/circular-progress#migration","content":"Keep existing `size`, range, and formatting props on the root. To show only the circle,\ncompose the track slot and supply `aria-label` or `aria-labelledby`."},"476":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","type":"page","content":"Collapsible","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/collapsible"},"477":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-0","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","u