,"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/select","content":"Select is a dropdown for picking one or more values from a list of options. It renders a labeled trigger and a popover listbox, supports single and multiple selection, and submits naturally inside a form."},"1330":{"id":"/docs/components/select-1","page_id":"/docs/components/select","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/select#features","content":"Features"},"1331":{"id":"/docs/components/select-2","page_id":"/docs/components/select","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/select#installation","content":"Installation"},"1332":{"id":"/docs/components/select-3","page_id":"/docs/components/select","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/select#examples","content":"Examples"},"1333":{"id":"/docs/components/select-4","page_id":"/docs/components/select","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/select#props","content":"Props"},"1334":{"id":"/docs/components/select-5","page_id":"/docs/components/select","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/select#select","content":"Select"},"1335":{"id":"/docs/components/select-6","page_id":"/docs/components/select","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/select#selectoptions","content":"SelectOptions"},"1336":{"id":"/docs/components/select-7","page_id":"/docs/components/select","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/select#selectvalue","content":"SelectValue"},"1337":{"id":"/docs/components/select-8","page_id":"/docs/components/select","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/select#selectitem","content":"SelectItem"},"1338":{"id":"/docs/components/select-9","page_id":"/docs/components/select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/select#features","content":"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, a `Button slot=\"trigger\"`, `SelectOptions`, and optional `Text` / `FieldError`. Nothing is added for you, and what you write keeps the order you wrote it in"},"1339":{"id":"/docs/components/select-10","page_id":"/docs/components/select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/select#features","content":"**Trigger and options**: An empty `Button slot=\"trigger\"` renders the selected value and a chevron from the field. `SelectOptions` is the list in the popover the Select opens: it takes `ListBox` props (including `items` with a render function for a dynamic collection) plus `popoverProps` for the overlay. Write `Popover`, `Content`, and `ListBox` yourself to replace the whole overlay"},"1340":{"id":"/docs/components/select-11","page_id":"/docs/components/select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/select#features","content":"**Composed in another field**: Use `variant=\"control\"` to sit inside another field's `Group`, as a country-code select beside a phone `Input`"},"1341":{"id":"/docs/components/select-12","page_id":"/docs/components/select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/select#features","content":"**Single or multiple selection**: Set `selectionMode=\"multiple\"` to allow multiple values"},"1342":{"id":"/docs/components/select-13","page_id":"/docs/components/select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/select#features","content":"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"},"1343":{"id":"/docs/components/select-14","page_id":"/docs/components/select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/select#features","content":"**Validation states**: Use `isInvalid` with a `FieldError` and `isDisabled` for validation and disabled state"},"1344":{"id":"/docs/components/select-15","page_id":"/docs/components/select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/select#features","content":"**Sizes**: The field is a `SizeProvider`. `size` (`sm`, `md`, `lg`) sets the label, trigger, and options, which open at the same size even though they render in a portal. Without it, the Select follows the surrounding scope"},"1345":{"id":"/