ance"],[744,"**Automatic Caching**: Once loaded, the icon is cached in memory to avoid subsequent network requests"],[973,"**Avoid complex content**: Forms, date pickers, and multi-line content belong in a separate overlay, not in menu items."],[233,"**Bar padding** (multi-series): 4px between bars within a group"],[232,"**Bar width**: 12px (1.5 grid units)"],[695,"**Bento integration**: Extends Bento Icon with additional Antares-specific features"],[235,"**Border radius**: 8px on all bars"],[1666,"**Center** — when the group acts as a prominent toggle affecting an entire section or page."],[323,"**Chart container:** `data-width`, `data-height`, `data-x-labels`, `data-y-labels`, `data-x-labels-vertical`, `data-x-baseline`, `data-y-baseline`, `data-x-tick-marks`, `data-y-tick-marks`"],[768,"**Check browser console**: Look for network errors"],[271,"**Check container**: Ensure the chart container is not transformed or positioned in a complex layout"],[266,"**Check data**: Ensure `series` array has data and `xAccessor`/`yAccessor` return valid values"],[268,"**Check dimensions**: Ensure container has non-zero width and height"],[267,"**Check domains**: Verify `yDomain` (if set) includes your data values"],[766,"**Check icon name**: Ensure the icon exists in the CDN"],[270,"**Check scroll position**: The component accounts for horizontal scroll automatically"],[367,"**Checkbox:** `data-selected`, `data-indeterminate`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-disabled`"],[366,"**CheckboxGroup Container:** `data-invalid`, `data-disabled`, `data-required`, `data-readonly`, `data-orientation`"],[752,"**Client-Side Hydration**: The sprite sheet is generated and injected after hydration, causing a brief paint event"],[692,"**Color inheritance**: Uses `currentColor` by default for seamless theme integration"],[1551,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, `Input` or `TextArea`, `Text slot=\"description\"`, and `FieldError`. Omitting `Group` leaves the control as a direct field child with box chrome. Use an explicit `Group` for controls or adornments"],[1338,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, a `Button slot=\"trigger\"`, `SelectOptions`, and optional `Text` / `FieldError`. Nothing is added for you, and what you write keeps the order you wrote it in"],[1025,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, the control, `Text slot=\"description\"`, and `FieldError`. Nothing is added for you, and what you write keeps the order you wrote it in"],[947,"**Composable rows**: Each `MenuItem` renders a string label or composed content (icons, checkboxes). Use render props (`isSelected`, `selectionMode`) and pass `textValue` for typeahead."],[1340,"**Composed in another field**: Use `variant=\"control\"` to sit inside another field's `Group`, as a country-code select beside a phone `Input`"],[923,"**Composes into other components**: `Select` uses `ListBox` internally; reach for `ListBox` directly when you need an inline list rather than a popover dropdown."],[763,"**Consider preloading** frequently used icons to reduce loading delays"],[921,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `selectedKeys` and `onSelectionChange` for controlled state, or `defaultSelectedKeys` for uncontrolled."],[1029,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"],[1342,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"],[1554,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"],[1587,"**Controls keep the scale size.** A `Button` inside a lockup follows the surrounding\n`SizeProvider` or its own `size` prop, never the lockup's tier."],[1553,"**Controls**: A `Button slot=\"control\"` beside the input is an interactive affix; it picks up field chrome from context"],[859,"**Custom Components:** When using `as={MyComponent}`, Box accepts that component's props. If there's a prop name conflict, Box's props take priority."],[220,"**Custom domains**: Set explicit x and y ranges for controlled scales across multiple charts"],[219,"**Customizable axes**: Control gridlines, tick marks, axis titles, and tick formatting"],[275,"**Debounce resize**: The default 15ms debounce on `useParentSize` balances smoothness and performance"],[751,"**Deduplication**: Icon path data only exists once in the sprite sheet, regardless of how many times it's used"],[217,"**Design system alignment**: 8px border radius, 12px bar width (1.5 GU), consistent spacing"],[753,"**DOM Output:**"],[698,"**Events**: `onClick`, `onMouseOver`, `onFocus`, etc."],[1582,"**Every part names its role with a slot**: `eyebrow`, `title`, `body`. Unslotted text follows\nthe lockup's tier too: a bare `Heading` takes the title tier and a bare `Text` the body tier."],[769,"**Fallback content**: Provide placeholder content for loading states"],[757,"**Faster Rendering**: Browser optimizations for `<use>` elements"],[742,"**First Request**: When an icon is first encountered, it triggers an asynchronous fetch from the CDN"],[691,"**Flexible sizing**: Support for `width` and `height` props"],[1345,"**Form integration**: Set `name` and the value submits as part of a native `<form>` (multiple values submit as repeated entries)"],[745,"**Full SVG Rendering**: Each icon instance renders as a complete SVG element with all path data"],[234,"**Group gap**: Minimum 24px between bar groups"],[965,"**Group headings**: The group `Heading` receives `role=\"presentation\"` automatically and acts as a label for the group, not a real heading level."],[246,"**Grouped rendering**: Bars are rendered in SVG `<Group>` elements for logical organization"],[249,"**Horizontal charts**: Vertical scrolling when many categories exceed container height"],[238,"**Horizontal scrolling**: When data points exceed available width, the chart becomes horizontally scrollable"],[858,"**HTML Elements:** When using `as=\"