ious checkbox"],[1193,"**Tab**: Moves focus to/from the radio group"],[1315,"**Tab**: Moves focus to/from the segmented controller"],[1585,"**The body is `<Text slot=\"body\">`**, once or as many times as the copy needs."],[1583,"**The eyebrow is `slot=\"eyebrow\"`**, on either a `Text` or a `Tag`. The two forms swap\nfreely, and a `Tag` is sized to pair with the lockup."],[1584,"**The title is `<Heading slot=\"title\">`.** Pick the level from the document outline, not the\nvisual size: `size` handles the visuals, so `level={1}` in an `xs` lockup is perfectly valid."],[966,"**Title placement**: Place an optional `Heading` as a sibling to `Menu`, not wrapped inside (do not use `slot=\"title\"`; see \"Title and groups\" example)."],[1162,"**Titles overflow:** that's expected — titles truncate. Shorten the title."],[1643,"**ToggleButton Item:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focus-visible`, `data-disabled`"],[1642,"**ToggleButtonGroup Container:** `data-size`"],[254,"**Tooltips** use absolute positioning and scroll-aware calculations for accurate placement"],[243,"**Tooltips**: Show on both hover and focus for keyboard users"],[758,"**Trade-offs:**"],[700,"**Transform**: `rotate`, `flip` for icon transformations"],[1339,"**Trigger and options**: An empty `Button slot=\"trigger\"` renders the selected value and a chevron from the field. `SelectOptions` is the list in the popover the Select opens: it takes `ListBox` props (including `items` with a render function for a dynamic collection) plus `popoverProps` for the overlay. Write `Popover`, `Content`, and `ListBox` yourself to replace the whole overlay"],[945,"**Trigger and popover**: `MenuTrigger` wraps any trigger and opens a `Popover` with automatic card styling and hidden arrow. Use for desktop; use `Drawer` for mobile."],[969,"**Typeahead**: For composed labels (icons, checkboxes), provide `textValue` to `MenuItem` for typeahead search."],[860,"**Typed Refs:** Refs are correctly typed based 