lly."],[153,"`Calendar` values are `CalendarDate` objects. Import the date primitives you need from the `@godaddy/antares/date` subpath:"],[184,"`CardGroup` uses grid navigation: Tab enters or leaves, arrow keys move between Cards, and Space\nchanges selection. Enter activates row actions or links. Choose selection or `onAction`;\ncombining them prevents pointer selection."],[364,"`CheckboxGroup` is composed: write `Label`, a `Group` holding the `Checkbox` items, `Text slot=\"description\"`, and `FieldError`. The `Group` takes its axis, gap, and presentational role from the group's `orientation`, so a bare `<Group>` is all you need; pass your own `direction`/`gap` to lay the items out differently. Each `Checkbox` takes label text next to the indicator."],[425,"`ChipButton` for menu filters and other actions with a Chip-like appearance"],[437,"`ChipButton` is a real button and exposes menu state through `MenuTrigger`; provide an accessible name when the visible content is incomplete."],[421,"`ChipGroup` + `ChipList` + `Chip` for grouped values, selection, keyboard navigation, and removal"],[430,"`ChipGroup` owns selection and removal behavior. Use a Chip render prop for\nstate-dependent content, and `Button` with `slot=\"remove\"` together with\n`onRemove` for removable items. See **Toggle Chips** and **Removable Chips**."],[1692,"`className` and `style` apply to the tooltip panel."],[131,"`CloseButton` dismisses an overlay: it defaults to `slot=\"close\"` and renders an `x` icon labelled \"Close\"."],[506,"`Collapsible`: `data-expanded`, `data-disabled`, and `data-focus-visible-within`."],[512,"`CollapsiblePanel` is labeled by its trigger through `aria-labelledby` automatically."],[513,"`CollapsiblePanel` uses `role=\"group\"` by default. Keep it when the panel's content does not need\na navigation landmark; there is no need to set it explicitly."],[508,"`CollapsiblePanel`: `data-focus-visible-within`."],[555,"`commitBehavior` on `DateRangePickerCalendar` applies to